{"articleNo":"73658","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=73658&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2013년도 ‘지역인재추천채용제’ 7급 공무원 견습직원 선발시험 예비공고","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.10","hit":"4062","attachments":[{"name":"2013년 지역인재 및 기능인재 견습직원 선발시험 예비공고.pdf","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=73658&attachNo=72049"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">행정안전부에서는 공직 채용경로를 다양화하고</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">능력에 따라 대우받는 공정사회 구현을 위해 각급 학교에서 추천한 우수인재를 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">개월</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">~1</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년의 견습근무 이후 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7·9</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">급 공무원으로 채용하는 견습직원 추천선발제도를 시행하고 있습니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><br>이와 관련하여 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 선발을 위한 예비공고를 아래와 같이 안내하오니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">관심있는 학생들은 시험을 미리 준비하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.<br></span></font><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br><br><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">◆ </font></span><font color=\"#0000ff\"><font size=\"2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 견습직원 선발시험 일정</span></font></font></p><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><!--StartFragment--><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 72.31pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; HEIGHT: 11.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">시험명</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOT