aise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2013.10.31(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">목</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">◆ <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">우리대학교 추천 인원</span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">총 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span><br><font color=\"#4169e1\">&nbsp;&nbsp; <strong>☞ <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학교추천에 관한 자세한 내용 및 일정은 추후 안내 예정입니다</span></strong></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><strong><font color=\"#4169e1\">.(2월경)<br></font></strong></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" size=\"2\">◆ </font></span><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">지역인재 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">7</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">급&nbsp;공무원 견습직원&nbsp;지원자격<br></span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br>1) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학력<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학사학위 졸업자 또는 졸업예정자<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업예정자의 경우</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">추천일 현재 추천 받을 대학에 재적 중이어야 하며</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">, <br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">시험에 합격할 경우 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2014</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">년 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">월까지 졸업을 하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">편입생은 편입학한 대학에서 최소한 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학기를 이수한 경우에 당해 대학에서 추천 가능<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br>2) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">학과 성적<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업자는 졸업석차 비율이 각 과의 상위 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">10% </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이내에 해당하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; - </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">졸업예정자는 추천 당시 각 대학이 정하는 졸업 학점의 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3/4 </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이상을 취득하여야 하고 이수한 모든 과목의<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 평점을 기준으로 한 석차가 각 학과</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전공</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">의 상위 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">10% </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이내에 해당하여야 함<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><br>3) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">영어능력검정시험에서 기준점수 이상인 자</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><p style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.28pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.28pt solid; mso-table-overlap: never\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 58.64pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; HEIGHT: 23.64pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">시험종류</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 130.92pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; BACKGROUND: #c1d6ed; HEIGHT: 2.82pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.25pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.25pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=