st-font-family: 굴림\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">기타사항<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기타 자세한 사항은 첨부파일 참고바라며, <span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">본 공고는 예비 공고로 추후 내용이 변경될 수&nbsp;있습니다.</span><br></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 2월경에 행안부로부터 정식 공고가 있을 예정이며, 정식 공고 접수 후&nbsp;<strong>금오공과대학교 선발일정 및 서류접수</strong> 관련하여 자세한 사항 공지 예정입니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 지원자 서류 제출 기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2월말 또는 3월 초<strong>(예정)</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\"><font face=\"돋움\">지역인재 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">9</span><font face=\"돋움\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">급 및 기능인재 선발시험은 특성화고.</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">마이스터고 및 전문학사 대상으로 본교와는 무관합니다</span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 4) 기타 문의사항은 취업지원본부(054-478-7983)로 문의 바랍니다.</span></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
